<\/div><\/div>","Email":"anacristina_ge@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1163924520,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/d\/d1\/d1295c45_user-674-avatar?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":120,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"anaderoux","Id":206916,"Name":"anaderoux","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":254,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"faf97d3ad27ad2941cf50f7846aa3148","RawContent":"Hey, I finally get to post a *real* picture of my ring here! Scott officially proposed Saturday night.\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i7.tinypic.com\/4hwf6a8.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i10.tinypic.com\/48rq8n6.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n I&#039;m like a little girl - I can&#039;t help but look at it in every possible light to see just how sparkly it is!\n \n P.S. Sorry for the huge pics! I don&#039;t know how to resize them to make them smaller.","Attachments":[],"Id":8189,"PostDate":1164032588,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hey, I finally get to post a *real* picture of my ring here! Scott officially proposed Saturday night.<br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i7.tinypic.com\/4hwf6a8.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i10.tinypic.com\/48rq8n6.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> I'm like a little girl - I can't help but look at it in every possible light to see just how sparkly it is!<br \/> <br \/> P.S. Sorry for the huge pics! I don't know how to resize them to make them smaller.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"caroljohnston_2000@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1161815371,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206870.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"carolj","Id":206870,"Name":"carolj","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":254,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4e6ae5e0bf1a2c50a687d988e2cefa2c","RawContent":"&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/vbimghost.php?do=popup&amp;amp;ed=vB_Editor_001\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;I just realized I&#039;ve never posted my ring! Here it is...\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/imagehosting\/284456a57eebab86.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":9009,"PostDate":1164601008,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/vbimghost.php?do=popup&ed=vB_Editor_001\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span>I just realized I've never posted my ring! Here it is...<br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/imagehosting\/284456a57eebab86.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><\/a>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"katesig@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"98.247.242.206","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1154919300,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206773.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":85,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"-Kate-","Id":206773,"Name":"-Kate-","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":254,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ee5a095c2b7c1ee39ef9acb53773fb30","RawContent":"alrighty, here you go. We did a little mini ering\/wedding band photo shoot tonight...\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/img.photobucket.com\/albums\/v396\/nabumbah\/IMGP0570.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/img.photobucket.com\/album