0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; \"&gt; Finally! Our Save the Dates are complete! We decided not to do formal invitations because, well, its a verrrry small wedding. On the bright side, by having a limited guest list, we can pay attention to the extra special details. We&#039;re sending them in a pre-wedding mailer that includes a booklet with travel\/event info and a sweet treat.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; \"&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; \"&gt; *&lt;span style=\"font-size:10px;\"&gt;The&amp;nbsp;monogram on the cover tag was designed using&amp;nbsp;&lt;i&gt;Arms&lt;\/i&gt;&amp;nbsp;and Times New Roman fonts. On the second tag, I used&amp;nbsp;&lt;i&gt;Sloop Script&lt;\/i&gt;&amp;nbsp;and Times New Roman.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;\/div&gt; &lt;div style=\"text-align: justify; \"&gt;  &amp;nbsp;  &lt;img alt=\"_MG_9312.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/469493\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/&gt;  STD front tag  &amp;nbsp;  &lt;img alt=\"_MG_9306.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/469491\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/&gt;  STD back tag  &amp;nbsp;  &lt;img alt=\"_MG_9346.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/469495\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/&gt;  Pre-Wedding Mailer Packaging  &amp;nbsp;  &lt;img alt=\"_MG_9323.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/469497\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/&gt;  Outside Pre-Wedding Mailer  &amp;nbsp;  &lt;img alt=\"_MG_9324.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/469499\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/&gt;  Inside Pre-Wedding Mailer  &amp;nbsp;  &amp;nbsp;  &amp;nbsp; &lt;\/div&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1478146,"PostDate":1309294738,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\