{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":11,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":true,"HasAttachments":true,"Views":1076,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1832149,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":273652,"Name":"DianneP","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-273652.jpg?_r=1391126061","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1391636981,"LastPoster":{"Id":287511,"Name":"Johnsonspartyof2","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-287511.jpg?_r=1470362394","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":34,"Preview":{"Id":1832149,"PostDate":1391636981,"PostContent":"Hey Ladies! \u00a0 My fiance and I decided to do an unplugged ceremony (which is basically a ceremony...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"depatzke@gmail.com","IpAddress":"71.47.136.70","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1379788834,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-273652.jpg?_r=1391126061","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"DianneP","Id":273652,"Name":"DianneP","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.47.136.70","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76274,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"669f85d684242cf32537a2e007f3b0b6","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hey Ladies!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;My fiance and I decided to do an unplugged ceremony (which is basically a ceremony where we ask our guests to not try to take photos) to avoid any awkward photos with random cameras, phones or tablets making an appearance, and also to avoid any of our guests blocking shots from our photographer trying to get their own....&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;The rest of the time (reception, the rest of the wedding week), they are more than welcome to take pictures and upload\/ post them...&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Here is a great article that explains it...&amp;nbsp;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.huffingtonpost.com\/bridal-guide\/why-you-might-want-to-con_b_3331528.html?utm_hp_ref=fb&amp;amp;src=sp&amp;amp;comm_ref=false&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.huffingtonpost.com\/bridal-guide\/why-you-might-want-to-con_b_3331528.html?utm_hp_ref=fb&amp;amp;src=sp&amp;amp;comm_ref=false&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Here are the cards that I made to put in the welcome bags and also on a table at the ceremony.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Let me know your thoughts!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1832149,"PostDate":1391636981,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hey Ladies!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My fiance and I decided to do an unplugged ceremony (which is basically a ceremony where we ask our guests to not try to take photos) to avoid any awkward photos with random cameras, phones or tablets making an appearance, and also to avoid any of our guests blocking shots from our photographer trying to get their own....<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>The rest of the time (reception, the rest of the wedding week), they are more than welcome to take pictures and upload\/ post them...<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Here is a great article that explains it...\u00a0<a href='http:\/\/www.huffingtonpost.com\/bridal-guide\/why-you-might-want-to-con_b_3331528.html?utm_hp_ref=fb&src=sp&comm_ref=false' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.huffingto...&comm_ref=false<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Here are the cards that I made to put in the welcome bags and also on a table at the ceremony.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1832149]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2014\/post-273652-0-97428500-1391651322.jpg\" title=\"photo card.jpg - Size: 167.8KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2014\/post-273652-0-97428500-1391651322.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"photo card.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Let me know your thoughts!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"depatzke@gmail.com","IpAddress":"71.47.136.70","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1379788834,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-273652.jpg?_r=1391126061","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"DianneP","Id":273652,"Name":"DianneP","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.89.189.10","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76274,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e76b092e660aa3fc8970f7e53ba065c8","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Looks Great&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1832154,"PostDate":1391637644,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Looks Great<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tracynichols@sbcglobal.net","IpAddress":"99.89.189.10","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1264826841,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-225165.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"traylynn","Id":225165,"Name":"traylynn","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"184.148.79.60","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76274,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1c8e0660149d79b75526e9e1d3d93a6c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Well done on the presentation!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1832174,"PostDate":1391640603,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Well done on the presentation!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>I said \"yes\" again to the love of my life at Grand Coral Beach Club, Playa del Carmen, Mexico on our 4th anniversary - October 20, 2015<\/em><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/'><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/<\/em><\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283444599,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.47.136.70","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76274,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"13e6287f9b948edb1b90133687606ce8","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"acw271011\"] Thanks! I wish I could say I came up with it all on my own, but I stole part of it from that link. :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1832184,"PostDate":1391642887,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n      