       <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"meghartman@gmail.com","IpAddress":"75.97.112.145","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1374432186,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-271770.jpg?_r=1391556917","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":159,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"megan224","Id":271770,"Name":"megan224","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"72.197.201.69","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76274,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3862d04e2415d5f970e298253d938e0d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"DianneP\"] This is a great idea! I mean we all are hiring a photographer so it would just be nice to allow your guests to sit back and enjoy the wedding!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Happy planning,&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Kristen.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1833864,"PostDate":1392510869,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"273652\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/273652-diannep\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">DianneP<\/span><\/a> This is a great idea! I mean we all are hiring a photographer so it would just be nice to allow your guests to sit back and enjoy the wedding!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Happy planning,<\/p>\n<p>Kristen.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kristennicole20040@gmail.com","IpAddress":"72.197.155.252","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1390409343,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276272.jpg?_r=1423510309","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"CurlyKristen","Id":276272,"Name":"CurlyKristen","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.36.29.67","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76274,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7d8bbca59ee5e2b98838c168530d852b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;It sounds good &amp;amp; Its good idea to have such kind of ceremony but you can&#039;t capture this moment. How would you capture such moment!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1834078,"PostDate":1392607170,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>It sounds good & Its good idea to have such kind of ceremony but you can't capture this moment. How would you capture such moment!!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>My <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.a2zweddingcards.com\/christian-wedding-invitations'>latest Christian Wedding Invitation Cards<\/a> for my special wedding day!!","Email":"jsteyn416@gmail.com","IpAddress":"174.36.29.67","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1389235042,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275957.jpg?_r=1389249689","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mark21","Id":275957,"Name":"mark21","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.153.117.2","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76274,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"329e5633aecaf995463421fb14e4a367","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;good idea&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1839144,"PostDate":1395181410,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>good idea<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"curltop475@aol.com","IpAddress":"68.39.65.38","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1376387605,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-272533.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":89,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Traci Felton","Id":272533,"Name":"Traci Felton","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"97.119.93.19","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76274,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"47ee3c88213fa5c17665adeaea641949","RawContent":"Great idea!","Attachments":[],"Id":1841705,"PostDate":1396298834,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Great idea! \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"bambiderby@gmail.com","IpAddress":"205.132.110.2","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1395161860,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277216.jpg?_r=1395766815","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":218,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"forevertogether","Id":277216,"Name":"forevertogether","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"187.185.71.174","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76274,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ae0ccdc199182792a827ebcc3c187f01","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;A note to all brides thinking about doing this on their weddings --- do it! Your photographer will love you.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Although we understand that guests and family usually want to take their own pictures and capture memories of their own during the ceremony, it is the one special moment you have all gathered there to share, so it only makes sense to ask your loved ones to be there. In the moment with you.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Make sure to ask your photographer if they can provide you with the service of uploading images to a private, online gallery.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;What we do is send the couple a link to where the images will be, with the option of having guests sign up to receive an update once the images are posted (which is only 7 to 12 business days after the wedding). That way, everyone can access the ceremony images, share them on Facebook or print them out :)&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We hope the unplugged wedding trend is here to stay!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;This one post that became viral says it very well too:&amp;nbsp;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.today.com\/style\/unplugged-weddings-photographers-anti-phone-rant-goes-viral-t55546&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.today.com\/style\/unplugged-weddings-photographers-anti-phone-rant-goes-viral-t55546&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt; :P&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1915095,"PostDate":1469812339,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>A note to all brides thinking about doing this on their weddings --- do it! Your photographer will love you.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Although we understand that guests and family usually want to take their own pictures and capture memories of their own during the ceremony, it is the one special moment you have all gathered there to share, so it only makes sense to ask your loved ones to be there. In the moment with you.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Make sure to ask your photographer if they can provide you with the service of uploading images to a private, online gallery.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>What we do is send the couple a link to where the images will be, with the option of having guests sign up to receive an update once the images are posted (which is only 7 to 12 business days after the wedding). That way, everyone can access the ceremony images, share them on Facebook or print them out <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We hope the unplugged wedding trend is here to stay!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>This one post that became viral says it very well too:\u00a0<a href='http:\/\/www.today.com\/style\/unplugged-weddings-photographers-anti-phone-rant-goes-viral-t55546' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.today.com...es-viral-t55546<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p> <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/tongue.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':P' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:15px;\">WeddingDayStory Photo & Video<\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n<p><em>Celebrating the Simple Romance of Weddings in the Sun<\/em><\/p>\n<p>\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7<\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' hr